@startuml Password Reset Flow

title Password Reset System - Complete Flow

actor Patient
participant "Login Page" as Login
participant "Forgot Password\nPage" as ForgotPW
participant "API:\nforgot-password" as API1
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Email Service" as Email
participant "Reset Password\nPage" as ResetPW
participant "API:\nreset-password" as API2

== Step 1: Request Password Reset ==

Patient -> Login: Clicks "Forgot password?"
Login -> ForgotPW: Navigate to /forgot-password

Patient -> ForgotPW: Enters email
ForgotPW -> API1: POST /api/auth/forgot-password\n{email}

API1 -> DB: Check if user exists
DB --> API1: User found

API1 -> API1: Generate secure token\ncrypto.randomBytes(32)
API1 -> API1: Hash token (SHA-256)
API1 -> DB: Store hashed token\n+ expiry (1 hour)
DB --> API1: Token stored

API1 -> Email: Send reset email\nwith unhashed token
Email --> Patient: Email with reset link

API1 --> ForgotPW: {success: true}
ForgotPW --> Patient: "Check your email"

== Step 2: Click Reset Link ==

Patient -> Email: Clicks reset link
Email -> ResetPW: Navigate to /reset-password\n?token=xxx&email=xxx

ResetPW -> ResetPW: Validate URL parameters
ResetPW --> Patient: Show password form

== Step 3: Reset Password ==

Patient -> ResetPW: Enters new password\n+ confirmation
ResetPW -> ResetPW: Validate password strength\n(8+ chars, uppercase, lowercase, number)

ResetPW -> API2: POST /api/auth/reset-password\n{token, email, password}

API2 -> API2: Hash incoming token (SHA-256)
API2 -> DB: Find user with\nemail + hashed token
DB --> API2: User found

API2 -> API2: Check token expiry
alt Token expired
    API2 --> ResetPW: {error: "Token expired"}
    ResetPW --> Patient: "Link expired,\nrequest new one"
else Token valid
    API2 -> API2: Hash new password\n(bcrypt, 10 rounds)
    API2 -> DB: Update password\n+ clear reset token
    DB --> API2: Password updated
    
    API2 --> ResetPW: {success: true}
    ResetPW --> Patient: "Password reset successful!"
    
    ResetPW -> Login: Auto-redirect (3 seconds)
    Patient -> Login: Logs in with new password
end

@enduml
